The result is a report you can read, share, or build on, written in the same language you asked in. Whether you are evaluating a purchase, preparing for a meeting, studying a new subject, or simply curious, Deep Research Agent saves you hours of searching and reading and hands you the answer in one place.","avatar_url":null,"input_schema":null,"output_schema":null,"required_slots":[],"funding_paused":false,"available_now":true}

